### 1. Turn LED ON (Tests saving to DB)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/actuators/esp32_01/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actuator": "led",
  "value": "ON"
}

### 2. Turn Fan ON
POST http://localhost:8080/api/actuators/esp32_01/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actuator": "fan",
  "value": "ON"
}

### 3. Test Buzzer (Action)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/actuators/esp32_01/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actuator": "buzzer",
  "value": "beep"
}

### 4. Test Display (Text)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/actuators/esp32_01/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actuator": "display",
  "value": "Hello World"
}